!GEAR.DAT - Gear data file for most shadowrun gear
!-------------------------------------------------
!
! This file originated with Paolo's Gear.Dat file. It now includes
! data from most sourcebooks and some things from the web. See
! BOOKS.DAT for a list of source books and for control of which
! books are included by software.
!
!
! 02/01/96 Paolo M: provide original version
! 02/04/96 JW: update
!          Gurth: add accessories field to firearms
! 08/13/99 McMackie: eliminate duplicate entries and add SR3 support
! 06/10/02 Wordman: add weapon entries and many corrections
! 12/14/02 Jon Yarwood: add SOTA entries
! 01/03/03 Josef Wegner: add Target: Wastelands entries
! 10/17/03 TinkerGnome: add Biotech from M&M
! 11/14/03 TinkerGnome: update lots of stuff with Ratings
! 02/21/04 OurTeam: corrections
! 04/18/04 TinkerGnome: Added skillsoft jukeboxes, rearranged firearms, added much chemtech
! 12/03/04 Thistledown: added SOTA2064
!-------
